## Example Usage

{{ tffile "examples/Cluster Profiles/resource/Import/resource.tf" }}

Using `terraform import`, import the cluster profile using the `cluster_profile_name` or `id` colon separated with `context` and `version`. For example:

```console
terraform import {{ .Name }}.{cluster_profile_uid}/{cluster_profile_name}:context:version 
terraform import {{ .Name }}.{cluster_profile_uid}/{cluster_profile_name}:context 
```

Refer to the [Import section](/docs#import) to learn more.

